            "review_text": "Vivian\nStockholm, Sweden2 contributions\n0\nReally ripped of and discusting\nDec 2014\nI couldnt agree more to prevouis scriber. We went there after lunch time and the food was cold and they didnt heat it. We ordered for five persons, chicken, vegetables, rice and soup. The dishes was really small on very tiny plates and viets sitting at the table besides us had bigger plate for two person. My daughter find two nails in one of the dishes. We couldnt eat more and as I suspected they realy take overprices. \n Save your money and dont eat there.\n\nInstead I higly recommend a restaurant at Da tham street. Go all the way to the South and I think its the last one called Quan.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 20, 2014",
