            "review_text": "TSSU\n4 contributions\n0\nIt's a rip off\nMay 2014\nI went to Minh Duc based on the positive recommendations of this blog. The food is nothing more than what Malaysian called 'mixed rice' - ready cooked food. It's supposed to be economical - inexpensive. We ordered a few dishes. The servings were small - mainly vegetable. The bill came up to 570,000 Dong - about 90 Ringgit, a hefty sum for 'mixed rice' for 3 persons. I later checked with locals as well as expats who have been in HCMC for years. They all agreed - it's a rip off place that no local would request.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 14, 2014",
