            "review_text": "V H\nSeattle, Washington120 contributions\n0\nBest local restaurant in Saigon\nJan 2014\nMy family and I visited this restaurant multiple times. This is a Vietnamese \"Buffet Restaurant\", the food is displayed or prepare fresh at the entrance. You tell the cook/server what you want (or point to the dishes. Also tell the. For how many people so they can portion control.\n\nThen find your table. The foods come in minutes. The style of cuisine is southern style and very popular with local people (not many travelers here). It is also very cheap, about $2-3 per person for multiple dishes.\nRead more\nWritten April 6, 2014",
